<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $1.00 higher. Demand moderate. Top $50.50 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 49.00-50.00, some 50.50, few early 48.50</p>
<p>Sows Unevenly $.50-1.00 higher. Top 50.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  40.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs.  45.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  47.50-50.50</p>
</text>
